  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Heritage Initiative: Echoes of UNESCO Programs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Dominican National Commission for UNESCO is a government organization that depends structurally and administratively on the Ministry of Culture of the Dominican Republic. It is currently in a process of revitalizing and strengthening some of its main programs since last year biennium. For this project we aim to continue replicate and educate about the most emblematic UNESCO programs in the territory of the Dominican Republic, divided into 3 main components, these being the Network of UNESCO Associated Schools where we will continue the work carried out in the previous biennium, the Memory of the World program and the UNESCO Youth Program</narrative>
  </description>
